  "prefLabel": "Agr 3001.01 Identification",
  "priorExpiration": "2013-06-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 3001.01 Identification. Pursuant to RSA 466:13-a the following shall be used as methods of identification of cats:\n\n(a) Collars affixed with metal identification plates;\n\n(b) Numbered ear tags;\n\n(c) Identification tattoo; or\n\n(d) Surgically implanted microchips.\n\nSource. #6274, eff 6-25-96; ss by #7907, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 6-24-13\n\nNew. #10473, eff 11-27-13\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRULE | STATE STATUTE\n\nAgr 3000 | RSA 466:13-a",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr3000.html"
